Risk Management Framework

The Company has established a structured Risk Management Framework for identification, assessment, mitigation 
and monitoring of strategic, operational, financial, regulatory and business risks. The key risks monitored include:
• 
Raw material availability and price fluctuations;
• 
Agricultural and seasonal risks;
• 
Supply chain disruptions;
• 
Food safety and quality risks;
• 
Market competition;
• 
Regulatory compliance;
• 
Foreign exchange risks;
• 
Cybersecurity risks.

The Risk Management Committee periodically reviews major risks and mitigation plans and reports significant 
matters to the Board.
